                "text": "It wasn\u2019t enough for SCOTUS to force pregnancies with the Dobbs decision\u2014now they\u2019re stripping away prenatal care from pregnant women, over 40% of whom rely on Medicaid.\n\nAs a board member of Planned Parenthood LA, I\u2019m fighting like hell to protect access to the care our communities depend on.",
